              "type": "text",
              "style": {
                "width": "full"
              },
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "Key Visual & Brand Positioning:\nThe booth makes a striking impression with colossal beverage cans, instantly communicating the core business to international importers and making it seamless to attract and connect with target clients."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "Design Concept:\nBoasting a unique aesthetic inspired by a futuristic spaceship and an automated mega-factory, the architectural structure powerfully elevates brand presence, showcasing the scale and stature of one of Vietnam's leading enterprises."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "spans": [
                    {
                      "text": "Kinetic Highlights:\nTwo massive front pillars and the central giant can feature continuous rotation, creating a lively, captivating visual experience that outshines conventional static booths."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ],
